      "notes": "Launched July 2025 at Rp499 jt (Eco) / Rp599 jt (Plus) incl. battery, with early-bird prices of Rp468/568 jt; oto.com (Jan 2026) lists Rp468/568 jt incl. battery as the current price. Same specs 2025–2026. oto.com says 17 Level 2 ADAS functions; Moladin lists the parking/blind-spot aids used here. DC time is 10–70% in 25 min (Moladin also quotes 10–80% in 30–40 min). Moladin lists power as 349/174 (hp); oto.com gives 260 kW / 130 kW. CBU import; Subang assembly planned. Price is the battery-included (battery ownership) OTR Jakarta price; VinFast also sells with a battery subscription at a lower upfront price. Battery chemistry, motor type, AC/DC connectors and turning radius from the Vietnamese spec (bonbanh.com).",
